  "name": "Zesty 4th of July Summer Salsa",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Look no further than this zesty 4th of July summer salsa recipe that's quick and easy to make. This appetizer will lend some festive color to your table,",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Drain jalape\u00f1o juice into a large bowl. Finely chop jalape\u00f1os; add to juice. Stir in tomatoes, white onions, green onions, green chiles, and cilantro. Stir in lime juice; season with salt."
    }
